
~ start

match interaction_count
	when 1
		PLUM: I can't see my reflection... (scared)
		PLUM: Wa! (suprised)
		VINCENT: Sorry... It gave me a bad feeling... (sad)
		$> hide_node("Sprite2D")
		$> show_node("Sprite2D2")
		=> END

	else
		You don't want to spend time looking at this broken mirror.
		=> END
